OL,3,ATrump takes aim at Republicans but says
OL,4,ADemocrats did a 'good job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe president said that if he had been
OL,7,Fon the ballot, the Republicans "would
OL,8,Fhave won IN A LANDSLIDE!"
OL,10,FBut he also said that he accepted the
OL,11,Fresults of the election, telling The
OL,12,FNew York Times that he was "absolutely
OL,13,Fwilling to accept" them.
